        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Heres my config:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nrequire(\"mini.pick\").setup({\r\n  options = { use_cache = true },\r\n  window = {\r\n    config = function()\r\n      return {\r\n        border = \"none\",\r\n        col = 0,\r\n        row = vim.o.lines - 1,\r\n        height = math.floor(vim.o.lines / 3),\r\n        width = vim.o.columns,\r\n        relative = \"editor\",\r\n      }\r\n    end,\r\n    prompt_caret = \"█\",\r\n    prompt_prefix = \"> \",\r\n  },\r\n})\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut I see that you've committed a fix thank you!",
